  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of the centres of the circles, which touch the circle, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> externally, also touch the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis and lie in the first quadrant, is:",
